{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["To Avraham for a possession — it took effect after the giving of the money, as written: ונתן הכסף וקם לו. But it did not take effect and become confirmed as 'a burial holding from the children of Heth' for Avraham until he buried Sarah his wife then, and it was established as a burial holding from the children of Heth — as it says: ויקם לאחוזת קבר מאת בני חת."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {0 "The comment distinguishes between legal effect of the purchase (at payment) and its functional confirmation as a burial plot (at burial); the last clause quotes Genesis 23:20."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:44:52.479391633Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}